<title>USA: YPF SA postpones Yankee note offering.</title>
<headline>YPF SA postpones Yankee note offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>YPF SA's Yankee offering of $200 million notes has been postponed due to market conditions, market sources said.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>The B1/BB-minus deal being led by Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc was expected to be non-callable, maturing in the year 2001.</p>
<p>-- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
